"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Theorem2.4.2 print37/PDF49; §3.1.1 print65/PDF77; direct corollary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^-\">\\(\\mathcal C^-\\)</span> 是对应不含Cut的演算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 属于其结论空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\ \\to\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C^-}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=q\\land\\operatorname{CutFree}_{\\mathcal C^-}(\\pi&#39;)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\ \\to\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C^-}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=q\\land\\operatorname{CutFree}_{\\mathcal C^-}(\\pi&#39;)).\\]</div><button class=